    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "Nice pussy. Nice pussy. You're very content right now, aren't you Ellen? You live in a nice house. You wear pretty clothing. And best of all, you're married to a wonderful man who's promised to love you forever. You little suspect that he's about to go on a long journey."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 3,
        "line": 855,
        "text": "I was never interred. I told you before you know nothing of me. Nor do any of you. All I need is to sleep in darkness. Coldly thy rosy shadows bathe me, cold are all thy lights."
      }
